55
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,180
Merry Christmas!

56
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,457
Merry Christmas!

57
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:40,620
No time for sipping eggnog now.

58
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,977
All the Digidestined here in Australia are

59
