62
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,800
Whoa, it's Gen-Eye!

63
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:52,157
Actually, the name's Hogan.

64
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,475
I'm Gen-Eye's friend.

65
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,390
Help!

66
00:03:55,473 --> 00:03:56,303
Somebody help me, please!

67
00:03:56,386 --> 00:03:58,237
There's a boy on that sailboard!

68
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:00,673
Looks like he's being chased by a shark.

69
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:02,780
Look, he's got a Digimon with him.

70
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:06,417
You're right, which means that boy's
a Digidestined just like you two.

71
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:07,330
Huh?

72
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,880
That's not a shark chasing him!

73
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,037
I hope he's really good
with that sailboard

74
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,591
because he's got free Digimon on his tail!

75
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:19,930
Gazimon!

76
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,950
Shellmon?

77
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,190
Ebidramon?

78
00:04:22,273 --> 00:04:24,817
Sounds like the special at
the Revolving Sushi Bar!

79
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,580
Yeah, revolving!

80
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,641
You got an idea?

81
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,030
Ikkakumon?

82
00:04:29,113 --> 00:04:29,943
I got you, Joe!

83
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:31,330
Digimon!

84
00:04:31,413 --> 00:04:32,243
Don't just surf!

85
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:34,060
Put a little spin on it!

86
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,600
That was a pute.

87
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,230
Yeah!

88
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:48,520
Don't even bother drying off.

89
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:51,291
Yeah, you won't be staying here that long.

90
00:04:51,660 --> 00:04:53,057
Thanks a lot for the tip, mate.

91
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:53,970
It threw him for a loop.

92
00:04:54,053 --> 00:04:55,957
Names Derrick, you blood-stitchy destined.

93
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,317
Yeah, we're the A-team.

94
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,282
And who's this?

95
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:00,580
I'm Crabmon.

96
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:03,637
I'll use my scissors attack
on anyone who gets in my way.

97
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,896
If you need help, call me in a pinch.

98
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:07,100
Sorry, guys.

99
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:09,177
There'll be time for introductions later.

100
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:11,437
Hey, Ikkakumon, are you getting hungry?

101
