Shellmon pepperoni, and
extra Abedramon cheese!

104
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:19,930
Sausage?

105
00:05:20,020 --> 00:05:21,940
Pepperoni and cheese pizza!

106
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:24,368
Don't forget the hot sauce!

107
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:29,937
Armadimon, I bet you could use a bite!

108
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:33,840
Actually, I'm in the mood for a
triple dip Digimon rice pilaf.

109
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,800
Triple dip? Genji-mon!

110
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,240
Rice peel off!

111
